            "Give Prim_ST explicit span and visit-counter outputs, eliminating shared writes during concurrent trials.",
            "Dynamically schedule sufficiently large sibling batches with OpenMP using private constraints and results; retain the original serial loop for small batches.",
            "Merge counters and accepted partitions in original edge order, preserving the final current_span and subsequent LIFO search."
          ]
