            "Traverse contiguous neighbor ranges directly in caminhoTropi and deep instead of repeatedly scanning arvoreGeradora and allocating neighbor vectors.",
            "Pass immutable path-search graphs and membership/color vectors by const reference while retaining independent recursive path histories."
          ]
